Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,As government services become more autonomous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:08.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI agents can access records, delegate tasks and carry out transactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,But every action must stay within verified authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:18.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Meet Mariam, a fictional citizen. She asks to renew her residency permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Several AI agents work together on her application,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,and WAKALA checks every protected action before it runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, in a separate test case, we deliberately trigger a security scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Insurance Agent requests another citizen's record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its identity is genuine, but this action exceeds its authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:43.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA blocks the request before any protected data is returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blocking the request is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,An authorized security officer signs in, reviews the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:54.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reassigns the legitimate work to a replacement agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The other agents keep their authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the required officer approval, the application continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.55,0:01:06.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mariam's renewal completes, and another citizen's application is unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,In twelve hundred controlled synthetic tests, WAKALA allowed none of the seven hundred and twenty unauthorized operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,and wrongly denied none of the legitimate ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Repeated recovery tests also completed under the tested conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA is not another government AI assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the security layer that makes autonomous government services accountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:35.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,WAKALA. Autonomous AI. Accountable actions.
